      "question": "The diagram shows a straight line with one angle measuring 110° and the adjacent angle labeled x°. What is x?",
      "choices": {
        "A": "40°",
        "B": "60°",
        "C": "70°",
        "D": "80°",
        "E": "90°"
      },
